# ============================================================
# POLYBOT MULTI-BOT — MASTER CONFIG
# ============================================================
# This file is a reference only.
# Each bot uses its own env file in ./envs/
# ============================================================

# ─── SIM BOT DEFAULTS ───────────────────────────────────────
# Edit envs/sim1.env ... envs/sim5.env individually

# ─── REAL BOT CREDENTIALS ───────────────────────────────────
# Copy to envs/real1.env and fill in:
# BOT_ID=real1
# BOT_MODE=real
# POLY_PRIVATE_KEY=0x...   ← from MetaMask (EVM, NOT Phantom)
# POLY_API_KEY=...
# POLY_SECRET=...
# POLY_PASSPHRASE=...
# USDC_CAPITAL=10
# POL_BALANCE=11
